task:
Eight more poses of the same narrator, for a cosy rainy-day episode:
1. sitting deep in a worn brown leather armchair (the whole armchair visible), wrapped up to the chest in a red and cream tartan blanket, holding a big steaming mug of hot chocolate in both hands, eyes half closed, blissful smile;
2. standing, wrapped in the same red and cream tartan blanket over his shoulders like a cape, holding the same steaming mug in one hand and pointing up with the other hand, cheerful;
3. standing, unfolding a big paper map with both hands, looking at the viewer over it, excited;
4. holding up a small paper museum ticket between two fingers, winking;
5. standing under an open black umbrella, ready to go out, cheerful;
6. holding up a smartphone towards the viewer with one hand, the screen facing the viewer, proud smile;
7. pointing down and to his right at something at his feet, looking at it;
8. shivering, hugging himself, teeth chattering, a little cold, comic.
